      ↑
Deploy/start VCF Installer
      ↑
Validate deployment JSON
      ↑
Deploy
      ↑
Validate resulting VCF
      ↑
VCF 9 OPERATIONAL
```

An engineer shouldn't have to remember how the environment was built.

