     └── ONLY where we've demonstrated a need
```

I like this discipline:

> **Nothing gets installed on the Recovery VM merely because it might be useful. Every component must satisfy a dependency discovered in Tests 1 or 2.**

That's how we avoid building another platform underneath the platform.

The VCF Installer API gives us an especially useful automation point: Broadcom exposes an API operation specifically to validate the SDDC specification before deployment. ([Broadcom Developer][2])

